-- `||` in a two-argument helper over two separate draw-bound coins, both as
-- the whole body and as a list element. Refused (set-valued witness for 'a')
-- until `and`/`or` counted as conditional for enumeration.
-- Task and-inside-list-or-helper-over-draws-refused.
either2 a b = a || b
main = draw a = Uniform < 0.3 in draw b = Uniform < 0.6 in (either2 a b, [either2 b a])
